# shape: a vendor sheet loaded by three pages: selectors matched everywhere, only under :hover, only through a dynamic binding, on no page (with and without a static carrier anywhere), plus a sheet no page loads; usage and the unmatched-page list at the selector grain (SPEC 3.5 iter2, 9.9)
kinds=usage,rule_usage,unknown
check=unknown_budget
@@@ file: src/a.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><link rel="stylesheet" href="s.css"></head>
<body>
<div class="card"><p class="x">a</p></div>
</body>
</html>
@@@ file: src/b.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><link rel="stylesheet" href="s.css"></head>
<body>
<div class="card" :class="{ open: o }"><p>b</p></div>
</body>
</html>
@@@ file: src/c.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><link rel="stylesheet" href="s.css"></head>
<body>
<div class="card"><span class="x">c</span></div>
</body>
</html>
@@@ file: src/orphan.css
.o { a: 1 }
@@@ file: src/s.css
.card { a: 1 }
.card:hover { a: 2 }
.card.open { a: 3 }
.card > p.x { a: 4 }
.never { a: 5 }
.card .missing, .card { a: 6 }
